menu "Wi-Fi configuration"

    config WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi network name (SSID)"
        default ""
        help
            The network the board joins at boot. Keep the default empty until
            you set it: this value ends up in sdkconfig, which is not committed.

    config WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password"
        default ""
        help
            Leave empty for an open network.

endmenu
